{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-08/1061719/block/singleImage/3256295/df/009_12.jpg?updatedAt=1793692041\"/><figcaption>荃灣石圍角邨。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>荃灣石圍角邨發生樹枝倒塌事件。 今日（3日）上午11時56分，荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓有樹枝由高處墮下，一名48歲姓萬女子遭擊中頭部。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，據了解，大樹約20米高，樹枝長約5米、直徑5厘米，跌落約25米下的行人路，女子半昏迷由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理，據了解，事主頭部傷口約10厘米長。消防員升雲梯，鋸斷其餘有危險的部分。警方圍封現場調查，案件列「有人意外受傷」及「塌傷」處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:16.504318+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:02:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:22.705383+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:48.313734+00:00","content_hash":"facff4207c1a5a3afc3449c64a0888eb58e3490ffc1445c8213bcc947c83a77c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:16.504318+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}